# Cloudflare Pages serves this repo's root as the public website. These paths
# held the admin dashboard, the edge-function source, the schema with its RLS
# policies and an old session export with real player names. All of it now
# lives outside the repo, and .gitignore stops it coming back; these rules are
# the second lock, so an old bookmark or a stray copy lands on the app instead
# of on a file nobody outside should read.
/Badminton%20Admin/*   /   301
/Badminton Admin/*     /   301
/admin.html            /   301
/schema.sql            /   301
/schema_admin.sql      /   301
/Badminton-Rotation.json  /  301

# Precedence probe, v67: README.md is still committed. If requesting it
# redirects, these rules beat a real file and are genuine protection. If it
# still serves the markdown, Pages prefers static assets and the only real
# guard is keeping the files out of the repo. Checked on deploy; see commit.
/README.md             /   301
